      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Berserker 8, powerful blow rage power</p><p>When using his powerful blow rage power, the berserker can forgo the normal bonus to damage to deal 1 point of ability damage to the target's Strength or Dexterity score. This damage increases by 1 point for every four levels the berserker has. The target can attempt a Fortitude saving throw (DC 10 + 1/2 the berserker's level + the berserker's Strength modifier) to halve this ability damage.</p>",
